
0. test usage syntax errors./crawler http://old-www.cs.dartmouth.edu/~cs50/data/tse/letters/index.html ../data
usage: ./crawler seedURL pageDirectory maxDepth
./crawler http://old-www.cs.dartmouth.edu/~cs50/data/tse/letters/index.html ../data-wrong 0
../data-wrong directory does not exist or not writable
./crawler http://old-www.cs.dartmouth.edu/~cs50/data/tse/letters/index.html ../data -1
maxDepth -1 must be an integer in the range 0 to 10
./crawler http://old-www.cs.dartmouth.edu/~cs50/data/tse/letters/index.html ../data 11
maxDepth 11 must be an integer in the range 0 to 10

test not writbale directory./crawler http://old-www.cs.dartmouth.edu/~cs50/data/tse/letters/index.html /tmp/not_writable_dir 1
/tmp/not_writable_dir directory does not exist or not writable

